title:  Snappier UI: ride pages are kept in memory, remote Previous Page without a full rebuild
desc:   data, map and free-climb pages are built once and shown again on later visits (refreshed at once); Previous Page from Di2 / ESS remotes no longer rebuilds the whole ride screen
